      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And with IK 2.0 my avatars head/hip distance is messed up. I'm constantly hunched over. Being able to match those distances with a scaling feature would make the new IK usable for me.\nAnd it's realy cool to have an avatar with abnormally long arms/legs and for it to still move \"normally.\" The current system makes it harder to have non-human proportions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
